Squall's build harness (devtools container, Makefile routing, three-phase test
pyramid) is derived from the ACKstorm alitellm-operator project.

Squall integrates with the following projects at runtime over their network
APIs. It does not incorporate their source code:

  - dstack (https://github.com/dstackai/dstack), Mozilla Public License 2.0 —
    used as the provisioning actuator via its server REST API and gateway.
  - LiteLLM (https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm), Copyright 2023-2026 BerriAI
    Inc., MIT — used as the front plane; Squall registers into it via
    alitellm-operator discovery.
  - vLLM, llama.cpp and Ollama — invoked as serving engines inside provisioned
    replicas, by container image reference only.
